sn45.34:6.4 starts: of mental defilements.
sn45.34:7.3 starts: Who through nonclinging find delight
sn45.34:7.4 starts: In the relinquishment of grasping:
sn35.248:5.4 none
an8.10:3.5 none
an8.10:3.6 starts: When, however, its head comes forth,
mn117:35.8 starts: In one of right action,
mn117:35.9 starts: In one of right livelihood,
mn117:35.10 starts: In one of right effort, wrong effort is abolished…
mn117:35.11 starts: In one of right mindfulness,
mn117:35.12 starts: In one of right concentration,
mn117:35.13 starts: In one of right knowledge, wrong knowledge is abolished…
mn117:35.14 starts: In one of right deliverance,
mn117:37.3 starts: If that worthy one censures right intention, then
mn117:37.4 starts: If that worthy one censures right speech…
mn117:37.5 starts: right action…right livelihood…right effort…right mindfulness…
mn117:37.6 starts: right livelihood…right effort…right mindfulness…right concentration…
mn117:37.7 starts: right effort…right mindfulness…right concentration…right knowledge…
mn117:37.8 starts: right mindfulness…right concentration…right knowledge…right deliverance,
mn117:37.9 starts: right concentration…right knowledge…right deliverance,
mn117:37.10 starts: right knowledge…right deliverance,
mn117:37.11 starts: right deliverance,
